0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Chassis construction adapted from the attributed circle-splitter ledger.
0 // One SPIKE hub, port A. Real turntable, fixed sun, compound planet and two-rail rack carriage.
0 // No authored joints, frozen bodies, custom parts or analytical motion directives.
